.TH ROTATETANK 1
.SH NAME
rotatetank \- a mesh under four matrices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/rotatetank
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I RotateTank
is a port of the TempleOS
.B Demo/Graphics/RotateTank.HC
demonstration.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Nothing but a mesh sprite and four matrix calls a frame.  The angles are
sines of the wall clock rather than counters, so the motion is a slow
rock rather than a spin: yaw and roll on a ten-second period, pitch on
five.  The scale is a sawtooth of period five, so the tank swells from a
quarter size to one and a quarter and snaps back.  The window is squared
off to twenty-four character cells each way, as the original sets it.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF "any key"
.TP
.B "any key"
Exit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/rotatetank.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR wm (1)
